---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/")
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work with Jane | Still Ground"
  description="Yoga, meditation, relaxation and dreamwork in small groups in Aylsham, and one to one online or in North Norfolk, with Jane."
>
  <section class="page-title section-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Work with Jane</p>
    <h1>Work with me</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I teach small groups in Aylsham, and I work one to one, online or in person.
      Both are about giving people the time and space to find out for themselves
      what these practices can do.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-narrow">
    <h2>Come and practise</h2>
    <p>Small groups in Aylsham.</p>
    <ul class="list-clean">
      <li><strong>Yoga Nidra Nights:</strong> deep relaxation on a warm floor, guided throughout.</li>
      <li><strong>The Hidden Language of Hatha Yoga:</strong> the symbolism and hidden meanings behind traditional yoga practices.</li>
      <li><strong>Introduction to Kundalini Yoga:</strong> a day of reflective study of the chakra system in the Yasodhara tradition.</li>
      <li><strong>Monday meditation group:</strong> free, weekly, and open to newcomers.</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="button" href={`${base}autumn-winter-workshops/`}>See dates and book</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>One-to-one sessions</h2>
    <p>Online worldwide, or in person in North Norfolk.</p>
    <div class="offer-grid" aria-label="One-to-one sessions">
      <article>
        <h3>Yoga, meditation and relaxation</h3>
        <p>
          Private sessions shaped around you: yoga, breathing, relaxation and
          Yoga Nidra, or learning to meditate from the beginning. We&rsquo;ll go
          at your pace.
        </p>
        <a href={`${base}learn-to-meditate/`}>Learn to meditate</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Dreamwork</h3>
        <p>Explore the symbols, patterns and insights in your dreams.</p>
        <a href={`${base}dreamwork/`}>Read about dreamwork</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split">
    <div>
      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>You&rsquo;re new to yoga or meditation and would like personal guidance</li>
        <li>You&rsquo;d like to restart a practice, or go deeper with one you already have</li>
        <li>You&rsquo;re curious about your dreams</li>
        <li>You want rest and quiet, without pressure or homework</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="note-panel">
      <p class="small-label">A note on scope</p>
      <p>
        These sessions are teaching and guidance in yoga, meditation, relaxation
        and dreamwork. They are not therapy, counselling or clinical mental
        health support.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-narrow about-jane-section">
    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>
      Holding space for people to experience the joy of their own discovery is
      deeply fulfilling. I love seeing people absorbed in their own journey,
      and delighted by the insights that come from their own experience. Each
      person is unique, and this work supports that so beautifully.
    </p>
    <p>
      People are often amazed at how deeply they can go through such seemingly
      simple practices. The genius of these practices is that they teach
      themselves. I just hold the space for that to happen. People tell me it
      blew their mind, that they hadn&rsquo;t realised all of that was inside
      them waiting to come forward.
    </p>
    <p>It&rsquo;s also what keeps me grounded myself. I&rsquo;m still learning from it.</p>
    <p>
      I&rsquo;ve taught yoga since 1999 (last century!), and I&rsquo;m a CPD
      teacher for the British Wheel of Yoga. I trained at Yasodhara Ashram in
      Canada, and I&rsquo;ve meditated every day since 2007. My meditation
      comes from Tibetan Buddhism, which I&rsquo;ve studied since 2021 with
      Chokyi Nyima Rinpoche and Phakchok Rinpoche.
    </p>
    <img
      class="profile-circle profile-circle-large"
      src={`${base}assets/jane/jane-profile.webp`}
      alt="Jane"
      width="260"
      height="260"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </section>

  <section class="contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
      <h2>Book a free 20-minute introductory call</h2>
      <p>
        Tell me what you&rsquo;d like to explore and we&rsquo;ll see what suits
        you, whether that&rsquo;s a private session or joining one of the
        groups. I&rsquo;m available online worldwide and in person in North
        Norfolk.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Email Jane</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
